### 10. Tilaus ennen versionoinnin alkamista
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/3/history?asOf=2000-01-01T12:00:00
Authorization: Basic admin admin_api_password

> {%
    client.test("Order before versioning: 404", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "Expected 404");
    });
%}

